    "daily_lesson": {
      "term": "Momentum Investing",
      "explanation_en": "Momentum investing is the strategy of buying assets that have been trending upward, on the theory that strong price movement tends to continue in the short term. Tools like RSI (Relative Strength Index) and MACD help identify stocks in a 'sweet spot' \u2014 moving up with conviction but not yet overextended. Today's picks targeted RSI readings of 55\u201368, which signal healthy upward momentum without the reversal risk of overbought conditions above 70.",
